# Copy to .env and fill in real values:  cp .env.example .env
#
# .env holds what pulse.yaml must not — secrets and per-machine values.
# It is gitignored; .env.example is committed so your team knows what to
# set. Every function receives these; a function's own `env:` in
# pulse.yaml overrides them for that function.

# STRIPE_API_KEY=
# DATABASE_URL=
